  "rule": "reporter_email: at most 254 bytes, all printable ASCII. local@domain with exactly one @. Local part: 1-64 chars of atext (A-Z a-z 0-9 and ! # $ % & ' * + / = ? ^ _ ` { | } ~ -) in dot-separated runs: no leading, trailing or doubled dot. Domain: two or more labels separated by dots; each label 1-63 chars of A-Z a-z 0-9 and -, not starting or ending with -; no IP literal, no underscore. Refused even when well formed (case-insensitive): support@feralfile.com, and a local part of mailer-daemon or postmaster. Empty string means absent.",
